[[File:S2E40 Sophie Kiel Balenpyre.png|thumb|Balenpyre engulfs [[Sophie Casterwill]] with flames]]
Balenpyre is able to create fire and to use it as a weapon. Its mastery over fire is evident in its ability to create powerful fire balls, breathe fire, and even create entire rings of fire {{Source|The Spiral War}}. Due to his large size, Balenpyre also possesses great strength. Due to his body being covered in flames, physical contact with an enemy Titan such as a punch can also burn the opponent in addition to the damage caused by Balenpyre's own offensive powers {{Source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}. His body is made of a very resistant volcanic rock. {{Source|Giochi Preziosi|Toy Card}}

